<description>&lt;p&gt;Thai forces have expanded their presence near the Myanmar border in Mae Sot as Myanmar bombs damaged a health centre in a border village and artillery strikes hit villages in Tak and Mae Sot, prompting warning shots and a temporary closure of unofficial border trade. Thai police arrested two Singaporeans for advertising Thai women’s sex services via messaging apps and seized meth pills hidden in furniture, while Cambodian nationals were detained for illegal crossing. The Myanmar military warned Thai traders against supplying the KNU, which in turn warned Thailand against supporting rival forces. The conflict caused 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxPT0hFWHdXT3NFQzVVVTVhNzl5dkUtVnVjZUlGd202TG1ERkluOW1MWk12TU8wUU40MW1kV0FYc2NqQVBJM0lvWk05Y1FFQUM0YWMzN0tTbkRvMlBwbXBpeTA3dVhvWEl3X1B6QVRjSXlCcjRGYmpZMnhpa0ZzOW1SQ0tSRXRKUTJZZWM2alBrbmpnWDdETzd0ZHBER3poSUdCcmVhY3lTWWZickVjVEtRd0ZIRFFBRDh4Wnhr?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nikkei Asia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiYEFVX3lxTE1yNGg3MWpIQi1YMTJJak8wSUtNZ09JQTVLTW1KVThkMFRRejVIUXRWSDhPbktOa1BVSVlaS0JTaFNCLS1Eb0ZJNGdiaDRIRXF0TlpKdDNKdmVBS1dkeE90QQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nation Thailand&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxNenNnMm5HM1JUcWdqMnVieEVvVXFaNG8wMXh2MGZOODZyQVdtNThuZ3NUaVR4anlzUWZwTXdxa1BGUWRwTG42MkxMdjhrRVRGR1dMajFVZVFKeHRJQnJLbTVTZV9PZWY1RlBwY2o5WEh2RTdWdWFqeFAwNHp6VjhJOWlCZHBhaDlMQkZYc29qZ0lYMWZzZ0FpX05SelNianFoTVgtUS11aW5jdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Thaiger&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxQN2l4YkxaamhCdDhtUkw0ZEVYZ0FQLVI1N2FUcjFqNzRZRFNyLWh5RXBVakd5dmtMV21ndFQ4R3ZTSVhRa1dnNnhmZWdzbi1iOUFOREx6bmNZVnpILTZ1ajZoN3VERzFyNmphckRWMnk3VldnZzdFVUt1cVBoQjZuX041dkg5OVpYb3FyTFcyTjZVMGw0a2x